<title>USA: Signature underwriters buy more shares.</title>
<headline>Signature underwriters buy more shares.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS, Ind. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Signature Inns Inc said Friday underwriters exercised their option to buy an additional 200,000 shares of cumulative convertible preferred stock in order to cover overallotments.</p>
<p>On January 21, 1997, the hotel company completed a 2.0 million share offering of its cumulative convertible preferred stock.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
